":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":32,"column":4,"offset":658}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 测试你的程序  \r\n\r\n在主网部署之前，进行彻底的测试是至关重要的，以识别潜在的漏洞和问题。\r\n\r\n经过充分测试的程序可以防止财务损失，建立用户信任，并确保应用程序在各种条件下正常运行。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Mollusk 测试\" id=\"mollusk-tests\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n当设置复杂的程序状态或需要复杂的链上交互变得困难时，Mollusk 提供了对测试环境更细致的控制。\r\n\r\nMollusk 是一个专为 Solana 程序设计的 Rust 测试框架，它可以让你：\r\n- 在没有网络开销的情况下独立测试程序逻辑\r\n- 轻松设置复杂的账户状态和程序条件\r\n- 比完整的集成测试运行速度更快\r\n- 模拟特定的区块链条件和边界情况\r\n\r\n我们在[这里](/zh-CN/courses/testing-with-mollusk)详细介绍了 Mollusk 测试。\r\n\r\n要测试你的 pinocchio 程序，只需在你的 `test.rs` 文件中使用 `test` 配置标志导入到你的 `lib.rs`：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#[cfg(test)]\r\npub mod tests;\r\n```\r\n\r\n运行你的测试使用：\r\n\r\n```\r\ncargo test-sbf\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"#[cfg(test)]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"pub"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" mod"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" tests;"}]}]}]}]}]}},"code-1":{"lang":"text","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"cargo test-sbf"}]}]}]}]}]}}}}